{title: 290 - Turn Your Eyes Upon Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #290 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 290}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F/C]O soul, [E/B]are [F/C]you [Am]weary [F]and troubled?
[Bb]No [Dm/A]light [C/G]in [Dm/A]the [F/C]darkness [C/G]you [F/C]see?
[F/C]There's light [E/B]for [F/C]a [Bb]look [Am]at the [B7]Savior,
[C]And [F/C]life [G]more [Am]abundant [Dm/F]and [C/E]free!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[F]Turn your eyes [C/G]upon [C7/Bb]Jesus,
[Dm/A]Look full [Bb]in [Am]His [Gm]wonderful [F]face,
[C/E]And [Dm/F]the [C/G]things [F]of earth [Am]will [C7]grow [F/C]strangely [Dm/A]dim,
[Bb]In the [F/C]light [C]of [F/C]His [Gm/D]glory and [Am]grace.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F/C]Through death [E/B]into [Am]life [Bb/F]everlasting
[Bb]He [Dm/A]passed, [C/G]and [Dm/A]we [F/C]follow [C/G]Him [F/C]there;
[F/C]Over us [E/B]sin [F/C]no [Bb]more [Am]hath dominion--
[C]For [F/C]more [G]than [Am]conquerors [Dm/F]we [C/E]are!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F/C]His Word [E/B]shall [F/C]not [Am]fail [Bb/F]you--He [F]promised;
[Bb]Believe [C/G]Him, [Dm/A]and [F/C]all [Gm/Bb]will [C/G]be [F/C]well:
[F/C]Then go [E/B]to [F/C]a [Bb]world [Am]that is [B7]dying,
[C]His [F/C]perfect [Am]salvation [Dm/F]to [C/E]tell!
{end_of_verse}
